/.lake

# LaTeX build artifacts
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
*.bbl
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls

# Derived paper builds. The two submission artefacts
# (sanctions_jet_draft.pdf, sanctions_jet_appendix.pdf) ARE tracked; these
# two are not -- the combined PDF is just the split pair bound together,
# and the notes PDF is internal. Rebuild both with scripts/Build-Paper.ps1.
sanctions_jet_combined.pdf
sanctions_jet_notes.pdf

# Derived plain-text / Word exports of the paper. NEVER commit or circulate
# these: on 2026-07-28 an external reviewer read a .txt export frozen three
# days earlier and faulted the paper for an omission the live sections had
# already fixed. Ship the PDF built by scripts/Build-Paper.ps1 instead.
# (paper/sanctions_highlights.txt is AUTHORED, not derived, and stays tracked.)
sanctions_jet_draft.txt
sanctions_jet_appendix.txt
sanctions_jet_combined.txt
sanctions_jet_draft.docx

# Local zip
Sanctions.zip
/SanctionPublicChoiceLean.zip
/dist/
SanctionPublicChoiceLean-core*.zip

# Obsolete root-level paper copies. Authoritative PDFs live in paper/.
/sanctions_jet_*.pdf

# Audit-zip backups — see docs/AUDIT-BACKUP-CLEANUP.md.
# Per the 2026-05-29 rule, all rolled-over audit zips live under
# backups/. This folder is local-only and never committed or shipped
# in the audit zip itself.
/backups/

# Scratch work belongs outside the repository or in docs/archive/ when retained.
/tmp/

# Local tool state (CodeGraph index, editor config)
/.codegraph/
/.cursor/

# Python scratch bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- Reference libraries: LOCAL ONLY, never distributed --------------------
# BookRefer/ and PaperRefer/ hold third-party copyrighted material: complete
# textbooks (Aliprantis-Border, Puterman, Stokey-Lucas, Topkis,
# Aubin-Frankowska), ~120 published-paper PDFs, and arXiv source bundles.
# They are research infrastructure (CLAUDE.md Rule 6 directs work to them) and
# they must NOT be redistributed: publishing them would be infringement, and
# the submission artifact is deposited under the author's name.
#
# Untracked 2026-08-09. The files stay on disk for local work; the shipped
# package cites them through docs/REFERENCES.md instead, which carries the
# bibliographic pointers with DOIs and no copyrighted content.
/BookRefer/
/PaperRefer/

# Legacy paper hand-off bundle name; no script regenerates it since the
# paper/ split (kept ignored)
paper.zip
